      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/backup_and_restore/control_plane_backup_and_restore/disaster_recovery/scenario-3-expired-certs#dr-recovering-expired-certs">Recovering from expired control plane certificates</a></li>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/machine_management/deleting-machine#machine-lifecycle-hook-deletion-etcd_deleting-machine">Quorum protection with machine lifecycle hooks</a></li>
      </ul>
